  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: New ELEInputKeyboard composite control (rounded panel + switchable TextBox/TextArea + virtual keyboard); ELEKeyboard full-keyboard digit/letter keys are now square with GetPreferredHeight(width) API and equal-ratio shrink to avoid overflow; ELECheckBox/ELERadioButton gain AutoSize (GDI+ text-measured width) and ELECheckBoxGroup/ELERadioGroup add button style (IsButton), size tiers, item spacing, vertical layout and min/max selectable; ELEAutoComplete/ELECascader/ELEMention add DropDownFontSize for popup items; ELENumericTextBox add ButtonWidth; ELETextArea add Placeholder and expose InnerTextBox/selection for virtual-keyboard targeting",
